    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Mga Channels na Papalabas", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Mananatili sa loob ng app ang mga kaganapan; kung gusto mo, ipadala rin ang parehong abiso sa notification centre ng iyong telepono o sa Telegram. Wala sa mga ito ang kinakailangan.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Ilagay ang pangalan ng paksa \u2014 hindi kailangan ng account", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Paksa", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Ipinapadala ang mga abiso sa paksang ito sa ntfy.sh; kung ikaw lamang ang nakakaalam ng pangalan ng paksa, ikaw lamang ang makakatanggap nito.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "Email", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Ipinapadala ang mga abiso sa email address ng iyong account", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Ipinapadala sa sarili mong address habang naka-sign in; walang lihim na iniimbak sa app.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Tumatanggap", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Abiso sa Iba't Ibang Device", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Dumarating ang alerto ng isang miyembro ng pamilya sa notification center kahit na naka-close ang app", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Pumupunta sa notification center ng iba pang miyembro at ng iyong ibang device; kailangang naka-enable ang channel na ito sa device ng tatanggap.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST sa sarili mong server \u2014 advanced", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Tinatanggap lamang ang HTTPS; bawat kaganapan ay ipinapadala bilang {source, id, title, detail, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Bot token", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "Chat ID", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Ang bot token ay nananatili lamang sa device na ito", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Hindi kailanman ina-upload ang token sa cloud; ilagay muli ito sa ibang device.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "System Notifications", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "Notification center ng iyong browser at telepono", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
