    "Son hata": "Huling error", // EN: Last error
    "\u015eu an rahats\u0131z etmeyin a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Naka-on ang Do Not Disturb ngayon.", // EN: Do Not Disturb is on right now.
    "\u015eu an sessiz saatler i\u00e7inde.": "Aktibo ang Quiet hours ngayon.", // EN: Quiet hours are active right now.
    "\u00dcstteki anahtar kapal\u0131": "Ang switch sa itaas ay naka-off", // EN: The switch above is off
