    "Baz\u0131 kanallar hata verdi": "May ilang channel na nabigo", // EN: Some channels failed
    "A\u00e7\u0131k kanal yok": "Walang channel na na-enable", // EN: No channel enabled
    "Sessiz saatlerde d\u0131\u015fa d\u00f6n\u00fck kanallar durur; uyar\u0131lar uygulama i\u00e7inde birikmeye devam eder.": "Sa panahon ng quiet hours, humihinto ang outbound channels; patuloy na nag-iipon ang mga alert sa loob ng app.", // EN: During quiet hours outbound channels pause; alerts keep accumulating inside the app.
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar sessiz saatleri a\u015fs\u0131n": "Hayaan ang critical alerts na lampasan ang quiet hours", // EN: Let critical alerts bypass quiet hours
    "G\u00fcvenlik, acil durum ve alarm olaylar\u0131 bu saatlerde de bildirilir.": "Ang seguridad, emergency at mga kaganapan ng alarma ay ipinapadala pa rin sa mga oras na iyon.", // EN: Security, emergency and alarm events are still delivered during those hours.
    "Ses ve Titre\u015fim": "Tunog at Vibration", // EN: Sound and Vibration
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar her zaman sesli gelir. Titre\u015fim yaln\u0131zca telefonda ge\u00e7erlidir; Android'de ses ve titre\u015fim ayr\u0131ca telefonun bildirim ayarlar\u0131ndan da de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir.": "Laging tumutunog ang critical alerts. Ang vibration ay naaangkop lamang sa mga telepono; sa Android, maaaring baguhin ang tunog at vibration sa system notification settings.", // EN: Critical alerts always sound. Vibration applies on phones only; on Android, sound and vibration can also be changed in the system notification settings.
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131nca ba\u015flat": "Magsimula sa computer", // EN: Start with computer
    "Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS arka planda a\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n.": "I-launch ang NEXUS sa background kapag nagsimula ang iyong computer.", // EN: Launch NEXUS in the background when your computer starts.
    "Kapat\u0131nca arka planda \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r": "Panatilihin sa background kahit isara", // EN: Keep running in background when closed
    "Pencere kapat\u0131lsa da otomasyonlar tepside \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam etsin.": "Patuloy ang pagpapatakbo ng automations sa system tray kapag isinara ang window.", // EN: Automations keep running in system tray when the window is closed.
