    "Sens\u00f6rler": "Mga Sensors", // EN: Sensors
    "Hareket, kap\u0131/pencere ve \u00e7evre sens\u00f6rleri": "Galaw, pinto/bintana at mga environmental sensor", // EN: Motion, door/window and environmental sensors
    "\u0130klimlendirme ve Enerji": "Klima at Enerhiya", // EN: Climate and Energy
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, r\u00f6le ve anahtar \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "Smart plug, relay at switch na mga produkto", // EN: Smart plug, relay and switch products
    "G\u00fcndo\u011fumu": "Pagsikat ng araw", // EN: Sunrise
