    "A\u011f \u00fczerinden PC veya TV uyand\u0131rma (Home Assistant standard\u0131)": "Gisingin ang PC o TV sa pamamagitan ng network (standard ng Home Assistant)", // EN: Wake PC or TV over network (Home Assistant standard)
