    "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ge\u00e7mi\u015f yok; yaln\u0131zca son okumalar d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131l\u0131r.": "Walang nakaimbak na kasaysayan; ang pinakabagong mga pagbasa lamang ang ini-export.", // EN: No stored history yet; only the latest readings are exported.
    "G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en cihaz ekleyince ger\u00e7ek de\u011fer burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Magdagdag ng device na sumusukat ng kuryente upang makita ang totoong halaga dito.", // EN: Add a power-metering device to see real values here.
    "{0} g\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcml\u00fc cihazdan ger\u00e7ek okuma.": "Live na pagbasa mula sa {0} metered device(s).", // EN: Live reading from {0} metered device(s).
    "Cihazlardan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131namad\u0131 (\u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olabilir).": "Hindi mabasa ang mga sukat (maaaring offline ang mga device).", // EN: Could not read measurements (devices may be offline).
    "\u00b7 Etkin (her gece 23:00)": "\u00b7 Aktibo (gabi-gabi sa 23:00)", // EN: · Active (nightly at 23:00)
    "\u00b7 Etkin (konum tetiklemesi yak\u0131nda)": "\u00b7 Aktibo (ang pang-trigger ng lokasyon ay darating sa lalong madaling panahon)", // EN: · Active (location trigger coming soon)
    "Bu strateji zamanlamayla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken (masa\u00fcst\u00fcnde tepsideyken) her gece 23:00'te se\u00e7ili enerji cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc keser.": "Ang estratehiyang ito ay tumatakbo ayon sa iskedyul: habang bukas ang app (sa tray sa desktop), pinapatay nito ang kuryente sa mga piniling energy device gabi-gabi sa 23:00.", // EN: This strategy runs on a schedule: while the app is open (in the tray on desktop), it cuts power to the selected energy devices nightly at 23:00.
    "Bu strateji konum tetiklemesine dayan\u0131r; otomatik konum tetiklemesi hen\u00fcz yok. Etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finde kaydedilir ama kendili\u011finden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Ang estratehiyang ito ay nakadepende sa mga trigger sa lokasyon; ang awtomatikong paglulunsad ng lokasyon ay hindi pa available. Kapag pinagana, ito ay nasasave, ngunit hindi ito tatakbo nang mag-isa.", // EN: This strategy relies on location triggers; automatic location triggering isn't available yet. Enabling saves it, but it won't run on its own.
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz otomatik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor; kaydetti\u011finde a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da se\u00e7ti\u011fin saatte (zamanlamayla) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ang uri ng trigger na ito ay hindi pa awtomatikong tumatakbo; kapag na-save, ito ay tatakbo sa oras na pinili mo sa ibaba (naka-schedule).", // EN: This trigger type doesn't run automatically yet; once saved, it runs at the time you pick below (scheduled).
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu tetikleyicisi kurulamaz: uygulamada okunabilen ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneli durumu veya NEXUS d\u00fczeyinde bir mod anahtar\u0131 hen\u00fcz yok. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Ang trigger na may security mode ay hindi maitatag: ang app ay walang nababasang estado ng alarm panel o NEXUS-level mode switch. Mga gumaganang uri: Timer, Weather, Device State, at Alarm Triggered (sensor).", // EN: A security-mode trigger can't be set up: the app has no readable alarm-panel state or NEXUS-level mode switch yet. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Bu tetikleyici t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Ang uri ng trigger na ito ay hindi pa sinusuportahan, kaya hindi ito masave. Mga gumaganang uri: Timer, Weather, Device State, at Alarm Triggered (sensor).", // EN: This trigger type isn't supported yet, so it can't be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State and Alarm Triggered (sensor).
    "Hava Ko\u015fulu": "Kondisyon ng Panahon", // EN: Weather Condition
    "Ev konumunun ger\u00e7ek hava verisi uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dk'da bir okunur. Ko\u015ful sa\u011flanm\u0131yorken sa\u011flan\u0131r hale geldi\u011finde senaryo bir kez \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ang totoong datos ng panahon para sa iyong lokasyon sa bahay ay binabasa bawat 10 minuto habang bukas ang app. Ang senaryo ay tatakbo nang isang beses kapag ang kondisyon ay mula sa hindi natugunan patungo sa natugunan.", // EN: Real weather data for your home location is read about every 10 minutes while the app is open. The scenario runs once when the condition goes from not met to met.
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k (\u00b0C)": "Temperatura (\u00b0C)", // EN: Temperature (°C)
