    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r.": "Kinakailangan ng cloud account ang two-step verification.", // EN: Two-step verification needs a cloud account.
    "Kapatmak i\u00e7in kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki kodu gir.": "Ilagay ang authenticator code upang patayin ito.", // EN: Enter the authenticator code to turn it off.
    "Kodu kimlik uygulamas\u0131na okut, sonra uygulamadaki 6 haneyi gir.": "I-scan ang code gamit ang iyong authenticator app, pagkatapos ilagay ang 6 na numero.", // EN: Scan the code with your authenticator app, then enter the 6 digits.
    "Kurulum kodu": "Setup code", // EN: Setup code
    "Kodu okutam\u0131yorsan bu anahtar\u0131 uygulamaya yaz:": "Kung hindi mo ito ma-scan, i-type ang key na ito sa app:", // EN: If you can't scan it, type this key into the app:
    "Kod 6 hane olmal\u0131.": "Ang code ay dapat may 6 na numero.", // EN: The code must be 6 digits.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti.": "Mali o nag-expire ang code.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti. Telefonunun saati otomatik ayarl\u0131 de\u011filse kodlar tutmaz; saati otomati\u011fe al\u0131p yenilenen kodu bir kez dene.": "Mali o nag-expire ang code. Hindi nagtutugma ang mga code kung ang oras sa iyong telepono ay hindi naka-set nang awtomatiko; ilipat ito sa awtomatiko at subukan ang bagong code.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired. Codes do not match if your phone's clock is not set automatically; switch it to automatic and try the refreshed code once.
    "Kod do\u011frulanamad\u0131.": "Hindi ma-verify ang code.", // EN: The code could not be verified.
    "\u0130\u015flem tamamlanamad\u0131.": "Hindi makumpleto ang aksyon.", // EN: The action could not be completed.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Ang two-step verification ay naka-on.", // EN: Two-step verification is on.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama kapat\u0131ld\u0131.": "Ang two-step verification ay naka-off.", // EN: Two-step verification is off.
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki 6 haneli kodu gir.": "Ilagay ang 6-digit na code mula sa iyong authenticator app.", // EN: Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app.
    "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator gibi bir kimlik uygulamas\u0131 a\u00e7.": "Buksan ang m\u1ed9t authenticator app tulad ng Google Authenticator o Microsoft Authenticator.", // EN: Open an authenticator app such as Google Authenticator or Microsoft Authenticator.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kodu okut ya da anahtar\u0131 elle gir.": "I-scan ang code sa ibaba o ilagay ang key nang manu-mano.", // EN: Scan the code below or enter the key by hand.
    "Uygulamadaki 6 haneli kodu yaz ve Do\u011frula'ya dokun.": "I-type ang 6-digit na code mula sa app at i-tap ang Verify.", // EN: Type the 6-digit code from the app and tap Verify.
    "Uygulamada eski bir NEXUS kayd\u0131 varsa sil; her kurulumda yeni anahtar \u00fcretilir, yaln\u0131z en son okuttu\u011funun kodu ge\u00e7erlidir.": "Tanggalin ang anumang lumang NEXUS entry sa app; bawat setup ay lumilikha ng bagong key, at tanging ang code ng huli mong na-scan lamang ang wasto.", // EN: Delete any old NEXUS entry in the app; each setup creates a new key, and only the code of the one you scanned last is valid.
    "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131lar: Home Assistant cihaz\u0131 ekle": "Mga advanced na koneksyon: magdagdag ng mga Home Assistant device", // EN: Advanced connections: add Home Assistant devices
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, cihaz kimli\u011finin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Hindi kumonekta sa device. Siguraduhing nasa parehong network ito at tama ang device ID at local key.", // EN: Could not connect to the device. Make sure it is on the same network and that the device ID and local key are correct.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parolan\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Hindi kumonekta sa broker. Siguraduhing tama ang username at password.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the username and password are correct.
