    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Tanggalin ang Aking Account", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Ang iyong account, profile at naka-sync na data ay permanenteng tinanggal. Kung mayroon kang aktibong NEXUS+ subscription, kanselahin muna ito sa Billing. Hindi ito maibabalik.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Sigurado ka ba? Tapikin muli para tanggalin", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Tinatanggal\u2026", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Account tinanggal. Tandaan na kanselahin ang iyong subscription mula sa iyong Whop account.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Ang iyong account at data ay tinanggal.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Upang alisin ang NEXUS data sa device na ito, sapat na ang Settings \u2192 Mag-sign out; wala nang cloud account.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Ang server-side na pagtanggal ng account ay hindi pa inilalagay. Maaari kang mag-sign out pansamantala.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Binuksan ko ang Do Not Disturb; walang abiso ang makakaistorbo sa iyo. [AKSYON: ENABLE_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"Maaaring patakbuhin ang scenario na ito nang isang tap lang mula sa Tap to Run card sa home screen sa ngayon. Kapag available na ang NEXUS sa App Store, maaari mo na itong idagdag sa Siri direkta mula sa screen na ito.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "\"at lahat ng mga setting nito ay permanenteng mabubura. Sigurado ka ba?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
