    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "Wala kang subscription \u2014 lahat ng tampok ay libre sa ngayon. Darating na ang NEXUS+.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
