    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "Estado hindi nabasa", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Ito na ang email address na ginagamit mo. Maglagay ng iba.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "Ang email address na ito ay nakarehistro sa ibang account. Subukan ang iba.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Masyadong maraming pagtatangka. Subukang muli sa ilang minuto.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
