    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, anahtar ve enerji \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "Smart plugs, switches at energy products", // EN: Smart plugs, switches and energy products
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Mabilis na pag-save ng flows para sa smart plugs at energy-focused na mga aparato.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Pagsamahin ang smart plugs at mga aparato na kumokonsumo ng enerhiya sa isang lugar. Gumawa ng instant na saving profiles at naka-iskedyul na eco actions.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Gumawa ng energy saving panel na nagma-manage ng smart plugs at mga aparatong kumokonsumo ng enerhiya. Magdagdag ng mabilis na shut-off, eco profiles, naka-iskedyul na pag-save at mga summary ng paggamit.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
