    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Ang 8-digit na code na ito ay para sa Apple HomeKit pairing at gumagana lamang sa Apple Home app. Kung sinusuportahan ng device ang lokal na API tulad ng Shelly, WLED, o Tasmota, maaari mo itong idagdag mula sa iyong lokal na network.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
