    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "I-type ang IP address ng aparato at malalaman ng NEXUS kung anong protocol ang ginagamit nito.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Suriin ang koneksyon sa Wi-Fi ng aparato at ng iyong router. Kung nagpapatuloy ang problema, alisin ang aparato at idagdag itong muli. Mga Hakbang: Mga Aparato > piliin ang aparato > Alisin.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Suriin ang koneksyon sa Wi-Fi ng aparato at ng iyong router. Kung nagpapatuloy ang problema, alisin ang aparato mula sa NEXUS app at idagdag itong muli.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Kung hindi lumalabas ang iyong aparato, gamitin ang QR scanning o setup code. Maaari mong buksan ang pahina ng tulong para sa suporta at gabay.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Ang lokasyon (GPS) ng iyong device ay naka-off. I-on ito at subukang muli.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
