    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Pamahalaan ang mga ilaw sa iyong bahay mula sa bawat kuwarto sa isang daloy. On/off, liwanag, temperatura ng kulay at mabilis na shortcut ng eksena sa isang app.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Magbigay ng handang mga utos, mabilis na awtomasyon at matatalinong mungkahi ng app batay sa mga device sa bahay.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
