    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "I-enter ang code na ito sa NEXUS desktop app. Kung ang device ay nakakonekta sa Wi-Fi, maaari mo rin itong idagdag mula sa lokal na network gamit ang IP address nito.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Hinahanap ang device sa parehong network at pinapares. Maaaring tumagal ng hanggang isang minuto; ang device ay dapat naka-on at nasa pairing mode.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ang aparato ay hindi natagpuan o hindi maipares. Siguraduhin na ito ay nasa parehong network, naka-on at nasa pairing mode.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Ang aparato ay hindi natagpuan. Siguraduhin na ito ay nasa parehong network, naka-on at nasa pairing mode. Maaaring hinaharangan ng firewall ng iyong computer ang mga tugon mula sa mga aparato sa lokal na network.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Hindi maipares ang aparato. Suriin ang pairing code at tiyaking ang aparato ay nasa pairing mode.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Naipares ang aparato ngunit walang ganap na function na makontrol ng NEXUS.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Hindi tumugon ang aparato. Siguraduhin na ito ay naka-on at nasa parehong network.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
