    "Enerji Cihazlar\u0131 ekran\u0131ndaki se\u00e7imin kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Ang piniling ginawa mo sa screen ng Mga Device ng Enerhiya ay gagamitin.", // EN: The choice you made on the Energy Devices screen is used.
    "Ayl\u0131k hedefin ne olsun?": "Ano ang dapat maging buwanang target mo?", // EN: What should your monthly target be?
    "Plan\u0131n \u00f6zeti \u2014 onayl\u0131yor musun?": "Buod ng iyong plano \u2014 kinukumpirma mo ba?", // EN: Summary of your plan — do you confirm?
    "Mesajlar \u015fifreli olarak g\u00f6nderilir ve saklan\u0131r. Bu evin \u00fcyeleri d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda kimse okuyamaz; ev silinirse mesajlar da silinir.": "Ang mga mensahe ay ipinapadala at iniimbak nang naka-encrypt. Walang sinuman sa labas ng mga miyembro ng bahaging ito ang makakabasa nila; kapag tinanggal ang bahay, matatanggal din ang mga mensahe.", // EN: Messages are sent and stored encrypted. Nobody outside this home's members can read them; if the home is deleted, the messages are deleted too.
    "Daveti G\u00f6nder": "Magpadala ng Imbitasyon", // EN: Send Invite
    "Sahipli\u011fi Devret": "Ilipat ang Pagmamay-ari", // EN: Transfer Ownership
    "Uygulama kapal\u0131yken aile mesaj\u0131 ve ev sahibinin payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 uyar\u0131lar gelir. Ana anahtar, kategori ve sessiz saat ayarlar\u0131n sunucuya kopyalan\u0131r; uygulamay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\u00fcncellenir.": "Ang mga mensahe ng pamilya at ang mga alerto na ibinabahagi ng may-ari ng bahay ay dumarating kahit nakasara ang app. Ang iyong master switch, kategorya at mga setting ng tahimik na oras ay kinokopya sa server; nag-a-update ang mga ito kapag binuksan mo ang app.", // EN: Family messages and the alerts the home owner shares arrive while the app is closed. Your master switch, category and quiet-hours settings are copied to the server; they update when you open the app.
    "Aile Mesajlar\u0131": "Mga Mensahe ng Pamilya", // EN: Family Messages
    "Ev \u00fcyelerinden yeni mesaj": "Bagong mensahe mula sa mga miyembro ng bahay", // EN: New message from home members
    "Yaz\u0131 Boyutu": "Laki ng Teksto", // EN: Text Size
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Adresin ve portun do\u011fru, broker'\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Hindi makakonekta sa broker. Siguraduhing tama ang address at port at tumatakbo ang broker.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the address and port are correct and the broker is running.
    "MQTT broker \u00fczerinden Zigbee lamba ve prizler (masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda); \u015fimdilik a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k": "Mga ilaw at plug ng Zigbee sa pamamagitan ng MQTT broker (sa desktop app); on/off at brightness sa ngayon", // EN: Zigbee lights and plugs through an MQTT broker (in the desktop app); on/off and brightness for now
    "Zigbee2MQTT cihaz\u0131 ekle (MQTT broker)": "Magdagdag ng Zigbee2MQTT na device (MQTT broker)", // EN: Add a Zigbee2MQTT device (MQTT broker)
    "Broker'\u0131n (\u00f6r. Mosquitto) yerel IP adresini yaz. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parola yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r. \u015eimdilik lamba ve prizlerde a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k desteklenir.": "Ilagay ang lokal na IP address ng broker (hal. Mosquitto). Ang username at password ay nakaimbak lamang sa device na ito. Sinusuportahan sa ngayon ang on/off at liwanag para sa mga ilaw at saksakan.", // EN: Enter the local IP address of the broker (e.g. Mosquitto). The username and password are stored only on this device. On/off and brightness for lights and plugs are supported for now.
    "Broker IP adresi (\u00f6r. 192.168.1.10)": "IP address ng Broker (hal. 192.168.1.10)", // EN: Broker IP address (e.g. 192.168.1.10)
    "Port (varsay\u0131lan 1883)": "Port (default 1883)", // EN: Port (default 1883)
    "Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 (yoksa bo\u015f b\u0131rak)": "Username (iwanang blangko kung wala)", // EN: Username (leave empty if none)
    "Parola (yoksa bo\u015f b\u0131rak)": "Password (iwanang blangko kung wala)", // EN: Password (leave empty if none)
    "Temel konu (varsay\u0131lan zigbee2mqtt)": "Base topic (default zigbee2mqtt)", // EN: Base topic (default zigbee2mqtt)
    "Cihazlar\u0131 getir": "Kunin ang mga device", // EN: Fetch devices
    "Broker'\u0131n IP adresini yaz.": "Ilagay ang IP address ng broker.", // EN: Enter the broker's IP address.
    "Port 1 ile 65535 aras\u0131nda olmal\u0131.": "Ang port ay dapat nasa pagitan ng 1 at 65535.", // EN: The port must be between 1 and 65535.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131l\u0131yor\u2026": "Kumokonekta sa broker\u2026", // EN: Connecting to the broker…
    "Broker'da NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi lamba ya da priz bulunamad\u0131.": "Walang ilaw o saksakan na kayang kontrolin ng NEXUS ang nakita sa broker.", // EN: No light or plug that NEXUS can control was found on the broker.
