    "G\u00fcvenlik modu Evde olunca": "Kapag ang security mode ay Nasa bahay", // EN: When security mode is At home
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu D\u0131\u015far\u0131da olunca": "Kapag ang security mode ay Wala sa bahay", // EN: When security mode is Away
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu Gece olunca": "Kapag ang security mode ay Gabi", // EN: When security mode is Night
    "G\u00fcvenlik modu (Evde/D\u0131\u015far\u0131da/Gece) de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde": "Kapag nagbago ang security mode (Nasa bahay/Wala sa bahay/Gabi)", // EN: When the security mode (At home/Away/Night) changes
    "Yaln\u0131zca NEXUS modunu de\u011fi\u015ftirir; cihazlara dokunmaz.": "Binabago lamang ang NEXUS mode; hindi nito hinahawakan ang mga device.", // EN: Only changes the NEXUS mode; it does not touch devices.
    "Mod de\u011fi\u015fince \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r (uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken). Bu mod NEXUS i\u00e7inde bir anahtard\u0131r; ger\u00e7ek bir alarm paneline ba\u011flanmaz ve cihazlar\u0131 kendili\u011finden kilitlemez.": "Tumakbo kapag nagbago ang mode (habang nakabukas ang app). Ang mode ay isang switch sa loob ng NEXUS; hindi ito konektado sa totoong alarm panel at hindi nito nai-lock ang mga device nang mag-isa.", // EN: Runs when the mode changes (while the app is open). The mode is a switch inside NEXUS; it is not connected to a real alarm panel and does not lock devices by itself.
    "\u015eimdiki mod:": "Kasalukuyang mode:", // EN: Current mode:
    "se\u00e7ilmemi\u015f": "hindi nakaset", // EN: not set
    "Konum tetikleyicisi hen\u00fcz desteklenmiyor, bu y\u00fczden kaydedilemez. \u00c7al\u0131\u015fan t\u00fcrler: Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131, Hava Durumu, Cihaz Durumu, G\u00fcvenlik Modu ve Alarm Tetiklendi\u011finde (sens\u00f6r).": "Ang location trigger ay hindi pa suportado, kaya hindi ito maaaring mai-save. Mga gumaganang uri: Timer, Weather, Device State, Security Mode, at When Alarm Triggers (sensor).", // EN: The location trigger is not supported yet, so it cannot be saved. Working types: Timer, Weather, Device State, Security Mode and When Alarm Triggers (sensor).
    "Uzak Eri\u015fim Adresi": "Remote Access Address", // EN: Remote Access Address
    "Evin d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndayken (VPN ya da port y\u00f6nlendirme) bir cihaza veya hub'a ba\u015fka bir adresten ula\u015f\u0131yorsan, yerel adres yan\u0131t vermedi\u011finde bu adres denenir. Yaln\u0131z bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Kung maaabot mo ang isang device o hub mula sa ibang address habang wala sa bahay (VPN o port forwarding), sinusubukan ang address na iyon kapag hindi sumasagot ang local address. Ito ay nakaimbak lamang sa device na ito.", // EN: If you reach a device or hub from another address while away from home (VPN or port forwarding), that address is tried when the local address does not answer. It is stored only on this device.
    "\u00d6nce bir cihaz ekle; sonra ona uzak adres verebilirsin.": "Magdagdag muna ng device; pagkatapos ay maaari mong ibigay ang remote address nito.", // EN: Add a device first; then you can give it a remote address.
    "Eve gelince": "Kapag umuwing bahay", // EN: When arriving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131nca": "Kapag umaalis sa bahay", // EN: When leaving home
    "Konum tetikleyicisi yaln\u0131zca mobil uygulamada \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; bu cihazda kurulamaz.": "Ang location trigger ay gumagana lamang sa mobile app; hindi ito maaaring i-set up sa device na ito.", // EN: The location trigger only works in the mobile app; it cannot be set up on this device.
    "Konum tetikleyicisi yaln\u0131zca mobil uygulamada \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ang location trigger ay gumagana lamang sa mobile app.", // EN: The location trigger only works in the mobile app.
    "Ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi. \u00d6nce": "Walang napiling home location. Una", // EN: No home location selected. First
    "Ev konumuna g\u00f6re \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Yaln\u0131zca uygulama a\u00e7\u0131kken denetlenir (arka planda konum izlenmez); yakla\u015f\u0131k dakikada bir okunur.": "Gumagana ito kaugnay sa iyong home location. Sinusuri lamang ito habang bukas ang app (ang lokasyon ay hindi sinusubaybayan sa background); binabasa mga isang beses kada minuto.", // EN: Works relative to your home location. It is only checked while the app is open (location is not tracked in the background); read about once a minute.
    "Konum izni verildi.": "Pinayagan ang permiso sa lokasyon.", // EN: Location permission granted.
    "Konum servisi bu cihazda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Hindi available ang location service sa device na ito.", // EN: Location service is not available on this device.
    "Konum izni verilmedi, tetikleyici \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaz.": "Hindi pinayagan ang permiso sa lokasyon; ang trigger ay hindi tatakbo.", // EN: Location permission not granted; the trigger will not run.
