    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "May account na gamit ang email na ito. Mangyaring mag-sign in.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Ang link na ito ay nag-expire o hindi wasto. Mangyaring subukang muli.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Ang Cloud account ay hindi aktibo sa build na ito; hindi ma-reset ang mga password ng lokal na account.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Kung ang address na ito ay konektado sa isang account, isang link para i-reset ay ipinadala na. Suriin ang iyong inbox (at spam folder).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Masyadong maraming pagtatangka. Pakisubukang muli sa loob ng isang minuto.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
