    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Hindi makakonekta sa device. Siguraduhing nasa parehong network ito at tama ang IP address at lokal na key.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Pinapailaw ang mga ilaw sa maligayang tono, binubuksan ang mga kurtina at sinasaayos ang AC sa 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Pinapailaw ang mga ilaw at binubuksan ang mga kurtina, pinapatakbo ang AC sa 22\u00b0 at pinapabalik sa charge ang vacuum.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Pinapatay ang mga ilaw, TV at AC, sinasarado ang mga kurtina at inilalock ang pinto.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
